# Gabriel Head Hide Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/features/head-hide/FEATURE.md`,
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`, and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/docs/RUNTIME-OPTIMIZATION-HISTORY.md` before changing
  this area.
- Use `features/head-hide/FEATURE.md` references to pull adjacent Gabriel docs
  when head-hide behavior crosses into improved-pov, passenger, or scene-camera
  logic.
- Current optimization notes: head target resolution is timer-based
  (about 200 ms) and reuses shared active-person and controller caches.
